REFERENCE PASSED
LANG_ENGLISH "Final Duel started"

REFERENCE FAILED
LANG_ENGLISH "Final Duel vote failed"

REFERENCE ALREADY
LANG_ENGLISH "A Final Duel vote was already called this round"

REFERENCE NOT_ALIVE
LANG_ENGLISH "Only alive players can call a Final Duel"

REFERENCE NEED_PLAYERS
LANG_ENGLISH "Not enough alive players for a Final Duel"

ENDMARKER
